PATH RECONCILIATION (no silent drift)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The prompt's templated output path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/PowerUser/**`
has no matching source root in this repo's XcodeGen spec. The Apple app's single
SwiftUI source root is `apps/apple/Sources/` (project.yml `sources: - path:
Sources`), shared by the iOS + macOS app targets; the existing feature tree is
`apps/apple/Sources/Features/<domain>/` (e.g. Sources/Features/Dashboard).
Following that established P4 precedent (see
p4-apple-dashboard-widgets-0015-BatteryRadialGaugeWidget.log, same reconciliation),
the surface ships in the REAL compiled root, decomposed one-concern-per-file
(swiftlint file_length/type_body_length/function_body_length honored):

  apps/apple/Sources/Features/PowerUser/GrafanaPanelCatalog.swift        (curated catalog data)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/PowerUser/GrafanaPanelServices.swift       (clipboard + draft seams)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/PowerUser/GrafanaPanelPageModel.swift      (@Observable model)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/PowerUser/GrafanaPanelPage.swift           (View: header/states/compose)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/PowerUser/GrafanaEditorSection.swift       (GlassPanel1 editor + JSON field)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/PowerUser/GrafanaCatalogSections.swift     (GlassPanel2/3/4 catalog)
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/PowerUser/PowerUserRouteRegistration.swift (nav registration)
  apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Features/PowerUser/GrafanaPanelPageModelTests.swift (13 unit tests)

Navigation registration (allowed):
  - Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift   : chains PowerUserRouteRegistration.registry(base:)
                                   into the routeHosts environment, registering
                                   `.powerUser` -> GrafanaPanelPage.
  - Sources/App/AppRouteParser.swift : adds deep-link aliases `/power` and
                                   `/power/grafana` -> `.powerUser`.
String catalog (allowed):
  - Localization/Localizable.xcstrings : +17 `powerGrafana.*` keys (web English verbatim).

SCOPE: the optional Helix natural-language drafter (web `AINLGrafanaPanel`, hidden
when AI mode is off) is OUT of this parity unit — the manifest lists only the four
deterministic GlassPanel sections and the 17 non-AI strings. No `powerGrafana.aiDrafter.*`
key is in scope; the deterministic editor + curated catalog are the canonical baseline.

UNITS: this page renders no numeric API data (curated catalog + local editor state),
so there is no SI conversion boundary to exercise. The curated `drives`/`charging_sessions`
column catalog is shown verbatim and already names SI columns (distance_m, energy_used_wh,
avg_speed_mps, …), matching the web source.

