------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATA STATES (loading / empty / error / success) — GrafanaPanelPageModel.ViewState
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GrafanaPanelPage.stateContent(for:) switches the model's state:
  .loading -> TSPageLoader (ProgressView)        .empty  -> TSEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView)
  .failure -> TSErrorDisplay + Retry (refresh())  .success -> the 4 GlassPanels (TSFadeIn)
The curated catalog is install-static, so load() resolves `.success` (the single declared
state); loading/empty/error are implemented defensively for every (future-dynamic) source.
HIG: 44pt iOS tap targets (.large buttons on iOS, .medium on macOS), accessibility traits on
panels/editor, VoiceOver labels, Dynamic Type via design-token fonts, light/dark + increased
contrast via Color.TS semantic tokens, Reduce-Motion-aware TSFadeIn.

